    {
      "id": "u_2e5ccc93812a3b95606948f7_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Trilium provides headings to define sections within text. Headings are numbered from 2 to 6.",
      "sourceHash": "2e5ccc93812a3b95606948f786b6cfcc54fe0f120cbdfaf35d5a3d6ede07c613",
      "context": "General formatting > Headings",
      "contextHash": "cd351c16e36c34804bb6494a22fb5c39a4efcdca75624d5f8a8ac420802e9b04",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_0f41a9761e65b6b905cc016c_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The reason why Heading 1 is missing from the list is that it is being reserved for the title of note.",
      "sourceHash": "0f41a9761e65b6b905cc016cb395edf00a36a6ba358f7f7db0ef69f22f96def1",
      "context": "General formatting > Headings",
      "contextHash": "cd351c16e36c34804bb6494a22fb5c39a4efcdca75624d5f8a8ac420802e9b04",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_bfe7d8c4331267fa339a33d6_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "To turn a heading back into a normal text, select __TRILIUM_PH_0__Paragraph__TRILIUM_PH_1__ from the list.",
      "sourceHash": "bfe7d8c4331267fa339a33d66d73a7f38beb9eafb210884c2394cf5efcc086b4",
      "context": "General formatting > Headings",
      "contextHash": "cd351c16e36c34804bb6494a22fb5c39a4efcdca75624d5f8a8ac420802e9b04",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_e0eeecd8ef2577905d78b8a7_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Apart from using the UI, it is also possible to quickly insert headings using the Markdown-like shortcuts:",
