    {
      "id": "u_b25a271977928e5da2be1c51_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Font size__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "b25a271977928e5da2be1c5186156e1cea377cb645fe3f4f7f7d77ec1faf4266",
      "context": "General formatting > Font size",
      "contextHash": "dd5ed77fc957cc5547bb51878bda86eb0fbf4b21fe6d8ac19fef88221242ae92",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_652b1318715401de07805166_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "One way to highlight a portion of text is to increase the size of the font.",
      "sourceHash": "652b1318715401de07805166a95bd830c615a84b960b35861e8a52d38b083677",
      "context": "General formatting > Font size",
      "contextHash": "dd5ed77fc957cc5547bb51878bda86eb0fbf4b21fe6d8ac19fef88221242ae92",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_4f5a1a834d54eec532f02b23_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "To do so, select some text and choose an option from the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Font size__TRILIUM_PH_1__ (__TRILIUM_PH_2__) selector (as pictured to the right).",
      "sourceHash": "4f5a1a834d54eec532f02b23c9aba67fc82d480b37e588e8b81237c9f26c6039",
      "context": "General formatting > Font size",
      "contextHash": "dd5ed77fc957cc5547bb51878bda86eb0fbf4b21fe6d8ac19fef88221242ae92",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_5b283dd2a3165a00c17c3efe_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Unlike other text editors such as Microsoft Word, the font size is relative (i.e. “Tiny”, “Small” instead of a number like 12).",
      "sourceHash": "5b283dd2a3165a00c17c3efe4f22e368acdb9d2c4633e382d873e9af894e27e0",
      "context": "General formatting > Font size",
      "contextHash": "dd5ed77fc957cc5547bb51878bda86eb0fbf4b21fe6d8ac19fef88221242ae92",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_990d550380caf9b9bfdec609_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Avoid using this feature just to simply make all text bigger. In that case it's generally better to adjust the font size for all notes in __TRILIUM_PH_0__Options__TRILIUM_PH_1__ or by zooming.",
      "sourceHash": "990d550380caf9b9bfdec609213c9b754a85f498446034985211b6edacdba4e4",
      "context": "General formatting > Font size",
      "contextHash": "dd5ed77fc957cc5547bb51878bda86eb0fbf4b21fe6d8ac19fef88221242ae92",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_e2b6be35ce73876321ad5213_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Bold, italic, underline, strike-through__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
