    {
      "id": "u_049e9db3bc5ee90895d214b9_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Text can be formatted as __TRILIUM_PH_0__Bold,__TRILIUM_PH_1__ __TRILIUM_PH_2__Italic,__TRILIUM_PH_3__ Underline or __TRILIUM_PH_4__Strike-through__TRILIUM_PH_5__ via the dedicated buttons (__TRILIUM_PH_6__, __TRILIUM_PH_7__, __TRILIUM_PH_8__, __TRILIUM_PH_9__) in the formatting toolbar.",
      "sourceHash": "049e9db3bc5ee90895d214b9774c594446aced27d46c5d0b0090fc14ecdac24a",
      "context": "General formatting > Bold, italic, underline, strike-through",
      "contextHash": "d9cd1595b18415a2b9ca92f7a644f21c935eafeeab8078424de179d1c834c5e6",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_2c570bf4ce4bfe7e090655cb_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "This formatting can be easily removed using the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Remove formatting__TRILIUM_PH_1__ (__TRILIUM_PH_2__) item.",
      "sourceHash": "2c570bf4ce4bfe7e090655cb33b630697fdd27249080c73841447c9f5aaacb4c",
      "context": "General formatting > Bold, italic, underline, strike-through",
