    },
    {
      "id": "u_721d692d4221f9c5788910e8_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "To remove either the background or foreground color of a text, select the corresponding formatting button (__TRILIUM_PH_0__ or __TRILIUM_PH_1__) and press __TRILIUM_PH_2__Remove color__TRILIUM_PH_3__ (__TRILIUM_PH_4__) or use the __TRILIUM_PH_5__Remove formatting__TRILIUM_PH_6__ (__TRILIUM_PH_7__) toolbar item.",
      "sourceHash": "721d692d4221f9c5788910e89625fa1bac3aa7ce7e895cf37e2526fee8f99308",
      "context": "General formatting > Font color and background color",
      "contextHash": "2a6bf631edb7686e3f2cb5da813f13e85254933043f7b8ae6c1109b8d4b3b51f",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_996b0e4a9853bae761129d6c_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Remove formatting__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "996b0e4a9853bae761129d6c660cc599fbbc7ab84f4d8cbf4a5b1a8ea3e4f0e0",
      "context": "General formatting > Remove formatting",
      "contextHash": "6ef2d3c16adb82762348fa9921510df9f6b9c1d95543399b051ff2dde9983513",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_6151d99ed5db8a53a8d8a114_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The __TRILIUM_PH_0__ __TRILIUM_PH_1__Remove formatting__TRILIUM_PH_2__ button is a quick way to eliminate the general formatting styling of a particular text.",
      "sourceHash": "6151d99ed5db8a53a8d8a114316e30446b49df5a88517fa7ae0a93c454ad18bd",
      "context": "General formatting > Remove formatting",
      "contextHash": "6ef2d3c16adb82762348fa9921510df9f6b9c1d95543399b051ff2dde9983513",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_12259d7e255a7b4534861a32_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Simply select the text and press the button to remove the formatting (bold, italic, colors, sizes, etc.). If the text does not have any removable formatting, the button will appear disabled.",
      "sourceHash": "12259d7e255a7b4534861a32f232dfc95fc1fb913d67e2ce8f7136868f51244b",
      "context": "General formatting > Remove formatting",
      "contextHash": "6ef2d3c16adb82762348fa9921510df9f6b9c1d95543399b051ff2dde9983513",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_1c4aa18cbadc7a77955db534_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Note that heading styles are not taken into consideration, these must be manually changed back to a paragraph according to the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Headings__TRILIUM_PH_1__ section.",
      "sourceHash": "1c4aa18cbadc7a77955db5341f648f9803f1072abf03ce005da146545c074411",
      "context": "General formatting > Remove formatting",
      "contextHash": "6ef2d3c16adb82762348fa9921510df9f6b9c1d95543399b051ff2dde9983513",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_e6d76e18a299e57f67fc4f7c_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "When pasting content that comes with undesired formatting, an alternative to pasting and then removing formatting is pasting as plain text via __TRILIUM_PH_0__Ctrl__TRILIUM_PH_1__+__TRILIUM_PH_2__Shift__TRILIUM_PH_3__+__TRILIUM_PH_4__V__TRILIUM_PH_5__.",
      "sourceHash": "e6d76e18a299e57f67fc4f7c7fec66d38e586f07f63be50ba51ca4c37bda001a",
      "context": "General formatting > Remove formatting",
      "contextHash": "6ef2d3c16adb82762348fa9921510df9f6b9c1d95543399b051ff2dde9983513",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_4f2e048938795d38b67beaa9_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Format painter__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "4f2e048938795d38b67beaa9ba03cf19eaa42d152bf4db9f4db06814f1d2fe9a",
      "context": "General formatting > Format painter",
      "contextHash": "08aed810d793c83e1beb97e8c150ceb35f75fa2e7276cec022af9abb23795995",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_f977ed376783a396d2e761c8_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The __TRILIUM_PH_0__Format Painter__TRILIUM_PH_1__ allows users to copy the formatting of text (such as bold, italic, Strikethrough, etc.) and apply it to other parts of the document. It helps maintain consistent formatting and accelerates the creation of rich content.",
      "sourceHash": "f977ed376783a396d2e761c8f98a15b1e8186e674dc278008280fe23af4fa651",
      "context": "General formatting > Format painter",
      "contextHash": "08aed810d793c83e1beb97e8c150ceb35f75fa2e7276cec022af9abb23795995",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
